<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Brazil's CSN raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brazil's CSN raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns said on Wednesday it had raised its rating for Brazilian steelmaker Companhia Siderurgica Nacional, or CSN, to attractive from neutral.</p>
<p>-- CSN's shares were off 0.29 real to 38.70 in Sao Paulo.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
